<title>RUSSIA: UES to announce tender for convertible bond lead.</title>
<headline>UES to announce tender for convertible bond lead.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's national power company UES said  it will announce the terms and conditions of a tender to choose lead  managers for an issue of convertible bonds on 5.4 percent of its shares  on Friday at 1200 GMT.</p>
<p>UES chief executive Boris Brevnov told a news conference on Friday  he expected to receive enough bids over the next two weeks to allow  a decision sometime around the end of August.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
